{"v":1,"code":"5271","name":"PECCA","long_name":"Pecca Group Berhad","updated":"2026-11-13 02:55","hash":"98fe58e89e61695b","recent":"Pecca 将于 2026 年 11 月 18 日召开第十六届常年股东大会，并已派发每股 1.50 仙的第四次中期股息。公司近期签署了谅解备忘录，同时董事局及多个委员会出现人事变动。最新季度营收环比增长 15.2%，但净利同比下滑 20.1%。","notable":["签署谅解备忘录（MOU），具体内容未在标题中披露。","宣布第四次中期单层股息每股 1.50 仙，除息日 2026 年 9 月 7 日，派发日 2026 年 9 月 18 日。","董事局及提名、薪酬、审计委员会出现人事变动，涉及 Madam Yong Hui Nee 和 Dato' Dr Norhizan Bin Ismail。"],"risks":["净利同比下滑 20.1%，净赚幅从 22.5% 降至 20.9%。","董事局及多个委员会成员变动，可能影响治理稳定性。"],"earnings":"2026 财年第四季度营收为 MYR 51.583 百万，环比增长 15.2%，但同比减少 2.4%；净利为 MYR 10.796 百万，环比增长 7.0%，同比减少 20.1%；净赚幅为 20.9%，低于上一季度的 22.5%。","facts":{"period":"2026-06-30","currency":"MYR","revenue":51583000.0,"net_income":10796000.0,"net_margin":20.9,"revenue_qoq":15.2,"net_income_qoq":7.0,"revenue_yoy":-2.4,"net_income_yoy":-20.1,"net_margin_prev":22.5,"loss":false},"ann":[{"id":"11687663","date":"2026-10-20","title":"PART A - STATEMENT TO SHAREHOLDERS IN RELATION TO PROPOSED RENEWAL OF AUTHORITY FOR THE COMPANY TO PURCHASE ITS OWN ORDINARY SHARES; AND PART B - CIRCULAR TO SHAREHOLDERS IN RELATION TO PROPOSED RENEWAL OF SHAREHOLDERS' MANDATES FOR RECURRENT RELATED PARTY TRANSACTIONS OF A REVENUE OR TRADING NATU","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11687663","cat":"corporate","tag":"routine","why":"购回授权及关联交易","why_en":"Buyback mandate & RRPT"},{"id":"11687695","date":"2026-10-20","title":"Annual Report & CG Report - 2026","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11687695","cat":"meeting","tag":"routine","why":"年报及公司治理报告","why_en":"Annual report & CG report"},{"id":"11687199","date":"2026-10-19","title":"General Meetings: Notice of Meeting","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11687199","cat":"meeting","tag":"routine","why":"常年股东大会通知","why_en":"AGM notice"},{"id":"11686843","date":"2026-10-19","title":"General Meetings: Notice of Meeting","link":"https://www.klsescreener.com/v2/announcements/view/11686843","cat":"